CLASSIFICATION DECISION TREE (Apply in order):
1. Does the image have 4 OR MORE panels/sub-figures? → AUTOMATIC COMPLEX
2. Does the image have MORE than 15 labels or annotations? → AUTOMATIC COMPLEX
3. Does the image have 5 OR MORE data series/lines on graphs? → AUTOMATIC COMPLEX
