5. Is this a BAR GRAPH with grouped bars or multiple categories? → MODERATE (never SIMPLE)
6. Does the image show a DATA TABLE printed within it? → MODERATE (must transcribe all values)
7. Is this a TABLE with more than 3 rows? → MODERATE (never SIMPLE)
8. Is this a TABLE with more than 10 rows? → COMPLEX (requires extensive transcription)
9. Is this a classification chart or matrix (multiple criteria)? → MODERATE (never SIMPLE)
10. Is this a dense multi-element figure that will require MORE than 700 characters to describe completely? → COMPLEX
11. Does it have 2-3 panels with moderate detail that can be described in under 700 characters? → MODERATE
12. Does it have multiple data series (3-4) requiring detailed comparison? → MODERATE
13. Is it a single-panel image with straightforward content describable in under 230 characters? → SIMPLE
14. Is it a single-panel image requiring 230-700 characters for adequate description? → MODERATE

