COMPLEXITY ESTIMATION TEST (Use this before finalizing classification):
- Mentally draft the long description
- Count approximately how many sentences you need
- If you need 1-2 sentences → likely SIMPLE
- If you need 3-6 sentences (one paragraph) → likely MODERATE  
