    - Statistical comparisons across 4+ groups with detailed annotations
    - Composite images combining multiple imaging modalities or techniques
    - Caption exceeds 50 words
    - Multiple anatomical structures (4+) requiring detailed spatial relationships
    - Requires more than one paragraph to describe adequately (AUTOMATIC COMPLEX)
    - Description naturally exceeds 700 characters when written completely (AUTOMATIC COMPLEX)
    - Interconnected information requiring guided navigation through multiple elements
    - Before/after comparisons across multiple panels with detailed changes
    - Time-series data across multiple time points (4+) with trend analysis
    
    CRITICAL COMPLEX TRIGGERS - If ANY of these are present, classify as COMPLEX:
